# SEO Guidelines for Paraguay Tech

## Metadata Requirements
Always include comprehensive metadata for SEO optimization:

### Required Meta Tags
- **Title**: Include "Paraguay Tech" and relevant keywords
- **Description**: 150-160 characters with target keywords
- **Keywords**: Include Paraguay-specific tech terms
- **Open Graph**: Complete OG tags for social sharing
- **Twitter Cards**: Optimized for Twitter sharing
- **Canonical URLs**: Use https://www.paraguaytech.com as base URL

### Structured Data (JSON-LD)
- Use Organization schema for community information
- Include contact information and social links
- Specify geographic coverage (Paraguay)
- Add founding date and area served

## Content Optimization
### Keywords to Target
- "Paraguay Tech"
- "comunidad desarrolladores Paraguay"
- "programadores Paraguay"
- "tecnología Paraguay"
- "desarrollo software Paraguay"
- "networking tech Paraguay"

### Content Structure
- Use proper heading hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)
- Include target keywords naturally in content
- Add alt text for all images with context
- Use semantic HTML elements
- Include hidden content for search engines when needed

## Technical SEO
### Performance
- Implement lazy loading for images
- Use proper rel attributes (noopener noreferrer)
- Add aria-labels for accessibility
- Optimize images with proper dimensions

### Accessibility
- Include descriptive alt text
- Use proper ARIA labels
- Ensure keyboard navigation
- Maintain color contrast ratios

## File Structure for SEO
- Keep sitemap.xml updated
- Maintain robots.txt with proper directives
- Include manifest.json for PWA features
- Use proper URL structure

## Monitoring
- Track Core Web Vitals
- Monitor keyword rankings
- Check Google Search Console regularly
- Analyze user engagement metrics